  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Maximum: Hollow Purple</em></p>\n<p>You have found a new more powerful way to fire Purple. As a reaction or action when a Blue is active, you can shoot a Red into it if it is within range. This forcefully creates a Hollow Purple that affects everything in a 100 foot radius around the source. This Hollow Purple deals maximum damage on a failed save or half as much on a success. You must also make a saving throw if you are within range. This technique cannot be used at <em>Maximum Output</em>.</p>",
